ontexts use separate PostgreSQL databases. Solid arrows = mapped JPA FK relationships within a service database. Dashed arrows = IDs / business keys crossing service boundaries or scalar/list references; they are not database foreign keys. DocumentIds and Claim policyNumber are not direct JPA associations. Auth model omitted from this ER view pending repository UserCredential structure." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff;strokeColor=#94a3b8;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=7;fontStyle=0;dashed=1;"><mxGeometry x="100" y="1050" width="1590" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>